{{Quote|text=}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the curator of the [[Stardew:Museum|Stardew Valley Museum and Library]]. He becomes a giftable friend when you donate 60 items to the museum. This also unlocks access to his room at the Museum.

Gunther is well read and knows much about the local history of the valley. He understands several languages and spends his free time doing archaeological research and studying scholarly articles written by his colleagues. Gunther also has a hobby of collecting ancient bottles.

For canon information on Gunther, please refer to the [[Stardew:Gunther|Stardew Valley Wiki - Gunther]] page.

{{TOC|limit=2}}

